   "author": {
    "id": "6690094455755080710",
    "uniqueId": "seansmoney",
    "nickname": "seans.money",
    "avatar": "https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-eu.com/tos-no1a-avt-0068c001-no/925a074e7f5835d8fbf61af588abb877~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:300:300.jpeg?dr=10397&refresh_token=8f87205a&x-expires=1791324000&x-signature=oYW2cXK9GUBKzZn5sGylYERZAQ4%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=d05b14bd&shcp=34ff8df6&idc=useast2b"
   },
   "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@seansmoney/video/7669798085471653142",
   "description": "What's stopping you from learning how to invest? If you're waiting until you have more money, you might be waiting far longer than you need to. For the last 78 weeks, I've invested just \u00a310 every week: \ud83c\udf0d \u00a36 into a global ETF \ud83d\udcc8 \u00a33 into an S&P 500 ETF \ud83d\udcbb \u00a31 into a semiconductor ETF I've invested \u00a3780, and the portfolio is now worth \u00a3941.83. The biggest benefit hasn't been the returns. It's that I've spent a year and a half learning, building consistency, and becoming comfortable with investing. Those habits will still be valuable when I can invest much larger amounts. You don't need to start big. You just need to start. This is what I'm doing, not financial advice. #investing #financialeducation #beginnerinvestor #dca #etf ",
